[[:db/retract 17592186306712 :question/answer-fields 17592186306713] {:db/id "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-0" :answer/id #uuid "8665a0d8-1aa1-5748-a7f9-5735334bc012" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-1" :answer/id #uuid "f84ef709-80ec-5e5c-9f54-a7704bfb0dd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8c48f7c3-575c-5400-b00a-eaa29762f740" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-0" "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-1"] :answer-field/correct "q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1/answer-1" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186306712 :question/problem "A car accelerates from the origin with an acceleration of $(3i-4j)\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ and an initial velocity of $2i\\,\\text{m/s}.$ Find the distance from the car to the origin$(|r|)$ after $4$ seconds.\n\n$\\,|r|=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$\\text{m}$" :question/worked-solution "With constant acceleration, the position is\n\n$$\n\\mathbf r(t)=\\mathbf r_0+\\mathbf u t+\\tfrac12\\mathbf a t^2.\n$$\n\nHere $\\mathbf r_0=\\mathbf0$, $\\mathbf u=2\\mathbf i\\,\\mathrm{m/s}$, and $\\mathbf a=(3\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}$. At $t=4\\,\\mathrm{s}$,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf r(4)&=\\mathbf0+(2\\mathbf i)(4)+\\tfrac12(3\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j)(4^2)\\\\\n&=8\\mathbf i+24\\mathbf i-32\\mathbf j\\\\\n&=(32\\mathbf i-32\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm m.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe distance to the origin is therefore\n\n$$\n|\\mathbf r(4)|=\\sqrt{32^2+(-32)^2}=\\sqrt{2048}=\\boxed{32\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm m}.\n$$" :question/answer-fields ["q-280531/mathematical-correction-v1/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
